5|DO THE RIGHT THING: Acting with integrity and empathy, especially in tough moments or when no one is watching.
5|ENLIGHTENED HOSPITALITY: Serving everyone with genuine care, humility, and long-term commitment.
5|TAKE OWNERSHIP: Stepping up to meet a need, creating solutions, and following up until meaningful results are achieved.
5|PASSION FOR EXCELLENCE: Taking pride in your work and unwavering pursuit of the highest standards.
To give any less than your best is to sacrifice the gift. — Steve Prefontaine
